HaploGrouperRS is a Rust adaptation of HaploGrouper.
Upstream copyright 2025 Agnar Helgason.
Upstream project: https://gitlab.com/bio_anth_decode/haploGrouper
The Python implementation and its command-line interface have been reimplemented
in Rust. The upstream license and copyright statement are reproduced in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. The HaploGrouperRS changes in version 0.2.0 include
compact genotype storage, streaming reference lookup and blockwise score output.
The project terms for these changes are in LICENSE.

Y-chromosome data: International Society of Genetic Genealogy, with tree and
locus tables prepared by the HaploGrouper authors and revised loci from deCODE
genetics. The data sources, versions and terms are listed in data/Y-DATA.md.

Jagadeesan et al., HaploGrouper: a generalized approach to haplogroup
classification, Bioinformatics 37, 570–572. DOI: 10.1093/bioinformatics/btaa729
